    "boundary": "Deterministic heuristic metabolism only. Carry-summary lineage comparison neutralizes volatile ref:/clause: hexadecimal identifiers and long hash tokens before diversity selection so provenance-only identifier changes do not masquerade as new metabolic content; carry rendering also rewrites ref:/clause: hexadecimal separators to ref=/clause= so the colon grammar cannot fragment lineage metadata into pseudo-clauses, while original nutrient atoms, routes and provenance remain untouched. Script-aware carry compaction runs whenever at least two fullwidth-colon clauses are present and treats a clause as substantive when it has at least 12 normalized characters or at least 8 CJK characters, allowing short meaningful Chinese phrases nested inside longer clauses to collapse in carry rendering without mutating source nutrients. Summary carry collapses repeated standalone machine lineage signatures of 5–64 characters containing _ or - only in carry rendering; distinct prose clauses and source nutrients remain intact. Summary carry additionally collapses consecutive exact 1–4 character colon-delimited token runs while preserving a single token. The middle-dot separator ` · ` is reserved for top-level carry item boundaries; the same glyph found inside a nutrient is neutralized to ` ∙ ` only in summary rendering so recursive carry cannot manufacture false pseudo-items, while the source nutrient and provenance remain unchanged. Inherited substrate subtraction removes only exact full normalized substrates; truncated prefixes are never deletion candidates. These rules are auditable heuristics, not semantic truth."
